<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Incircle radius of a non-right triangle (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>In triangle \(ABC\) the sides are
\(a = BC = {@opp@}\) cm, \(b = CA = {@p@}\) cm and \(c = AB = {@q@}\) cm,
and the angle at \(A\) is \(\widehat{A} = {@ang@}^\circ\) (marked in orange).</p>

<p>Find the radius of the <em>inscribed</em> circle (centre \(I\), in blue), in centimetres.
Work through the steps below, giving each answer <strong>to 3 decimal places</strong>.</p>

[[jsxgraph width='450px' height='430px']]
var Ax=0, Ay=0, Bx={#q#}, By=0, Cx={#Cxv#}, Cy={#Cyv#};   // angle given at A
var la=Math.hypot(Bx-Cx,By-Cy), lb=Math.hypot(Ax-Cx,Ay-Cy), lc=Math.hypot(Ax-Bx,Ay-By);
var per=la+lb+lc;
var area=Math.abs((Bx-Ax)*(Cy-Ay)-(Cx-Ax)*(By-Ay))/2, r=area/(per/2);
var Ix=(la*Ax+lb*Bx+lc*Cx)/per, Iy=(la*Ay+lb*By+lc*Cy)/per;
var xs=[Ax,Bx,Cx,Ix-r,Ix+r], ys=[Ay,By,Cy,Iy-r,Iy+r];
var xmin=Math.min.apply(null,xs),xmax=Math.max.apply(null,xs),ymin=Math.min.apply(null,ys),ymax=Math.max.apply(null,ys);
var pX=0.16*(xmax-xmin),pY=0.16*(ymax-ymin);
var board=JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid,{boundingbox:[xmin-pX,ymax+pY,xmax+pX,ymin-pY],
keepaspectratio:true,axis:false,showCopyright:false,showNavigation:false,pan:{enabled:false},zoom:{enabled:false}});
var A=board.create('point',[Ax,Ay],{fixed:true,highlight:false,name:'A',size:2,label:{offset:[-12,-8]}});
var B=board.create('point',[Bx,By],{fixed:true,highlight:false,name:'B',size:2,label:{offset:[10,-8]}});
var C=board.create('point',[Cx,Cy],{fixed:true,highlight:false,name:'C',size:2,label:{offset:[0,12]}});
board.create('polygon',[A,B,C],{fixed:true,highlight:false,fillColor:'#e3f2fd',fillOpacity:0.5,
borders:{strokeColor:'#222',strokeWidth:2,highlight:false,fixed:true},vertices:{visible:false}});
board.create('angle',[B,A,C],{type:'sector',radius:Math.min(la,lb,lc)*0.1,selection:'minor',
fillColor:'#ffb74d',fillOpacity:0.45,strokeColor:'#ef6c00',name:{#ang#}+'°',withLabel:true,fixed:true,highlight:false});
board.create('circle',[[Ix,Iy],r],{strokeColor:'#1565c0',strokeWidth:1.5,fillColor:'none',fixed:true,highlight:false});
board.create('point',[Ix,Iy],{fixed:true,highlight:false,name:'I',size:1,strokeColor:'#1565c0',fillColor:'#1565c0',label:{offset:[6,-2]}});
var sl={fixed:true,highlight:false,fontSize:15,anchorX:'middle',anchorY:'middle'};
var dx=0.06*(xmax-xmin),dy=0.06*(ymax-ymin);
board.create('text',[(Bx+Cx)/2+dx,(By+Cy)/2+dy,'a = '+{#opp#}],sl);
board.create('text',[(Cx+Ax)/2-dx,(Cy+Ay)/2,'b = '+{#p#}],sl);
board.create('text',[(Ax+Bx)/2,(Ay+By)/2-dy,'c = '+{#q#}],sl);
[[/jsxgraph]]

<div><strong>Step 1.</strong> The semi-perimeter is \(s = \) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] cm (to 3 d.p.) [[feedback:prt1]]</div>

<div><strong>Step 2.</strong> The triangle area is \(\Delta = \) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] cm\(^2\) (to 3 d.p.) [[feedback:prt2]]</div>

<div><strong>Step 3.</strong> The inradius \(r = \) [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] cm (to 3 d.p.) [[feedback:prt3]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Work step by step.</p>
\[ s = \frac{a+b+c}{2} = \frac{{@opp@}+{@p@}+{@q@}}{2} = {@ssemiexact@} \approx {@dispdp(ssemi,3)@}, \]
\[ \Delta = \sqrt{s(s-a)(s-b)(s-c)} = {@areaexact@} \approx {@dispdp(area,3)@}, \]
\[ r = \frac{\Delta}{s} = {@rinexact@} \approx {@dispdp(rin,3)@}\text{ cm}. \]
<p>So, to 3 decimal places, \(s \approx {@dispdp(ssemi,3)@}\) cm,
\(\Delta \approx {@dispdp(area,3)@}\) cm\(^2\) and
\(r \approx {@dispdp(rin,3)@}\) cm.</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
